# Recorded fixtures are evidence, not source.
#
# `test/fixtures/README.md` says to save the response body verbatim and keep
# everything exactly as the server sent it, because the fidelity is the entire
# value of the file. Prettier does not change JSON meaning, but it does reflow
# it — so a capture would arrive differing from the `curl` output it came from,
# and every future capture would need a formatting pass before it could be
# committed. `harness/` is excluded from the exclusion: those fixtures are
# hand-written, so they are source and are formatted like source.
test/fixtures/viya4/
test/fixtures/viya35/

# Markdown is deliberately not Prettier-formatted.
#
# Prettier rewrites *emphasis* to _emphasis_ and re-pads every table cell to the
# width of its widest neighbour. Both are pure churn, and the table padding is
# actively harmful: editing one cell reflows the entire table, so a one-word
# change arrives as a fifty-line diff and real edits hide inside it. These
# documents are hand-wrapped at 80 columns already. Prose style is a review
# question, not a tooling one.
*.md
